    javaScript {
        functionAndGlobalVariableDeclaration:
            ```javascript-browser
            function fnc_imprimir()
            {
              vurl = document.getElementById("P615_SESSION_IMPRIME").value;
              pjan = window.open(vurl,'popup','toolbar=no,location=no,status=no,menubar=no,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,width=800,height=700,left=250,top=100');
              pjan.focus();
            }
            ```
