            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                Select f.nome
                     , f.idfilial
                from vw_filiais f
                where f.ativo = 'S'
                  and f.tipofilial = 'D'
                  and exists ( select 1
                               from usuariosfiliais u
                               where u.idfilial  = f.idfilial
                                 and u.usuario   = v('APP_USER') )
                union
                Select f.nome
                     , f.idfilial
                from vw_filiais f
                where idfilial = pck_romance.fnc_filialusuario(v('APP_USER'))
                ```
